WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:09.068
Notice to Military Police: a formal Section 504 Criminal Code filing containing twenty-eight criminal counts is active against personnel within your chain of command.

00:00:09.068 --> 00:00:19.011
Under the National Defence Act, Section 83 obligates military police to investigate reported offences — failure to do so is itself an offence under Section 124.

00:00:19.011 --> 00:00:23.204
Receipt of this notification creates a documented legal obligation.

00:00:23.204 --> 00:00:29.659
Non-investigation after notification constitutes dereliction of duty and may constitute obstruction of justice.
